1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,820
Why did Mr. Gilbert telephone Dr. Millington?
吉尔伯特先生为什么给米灵顿医生打电话？

2
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:19,410
Why did Mr. Gilbert telephone Dr. Millington?
吉尔伯特先生为什么给米灵顿医生打电话？

3
00:00:21,910 --> 00:00:24,920
While John Gilbert was in hospital,
约翰·吉尔伯特住院期间，

4
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:31,300
he asked his doctor to tell him whether his operation had been successful,
他要求医生告诉他手术是否成功，

5
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:35,250
but the doctor refused to do so.
但医生拒绝这样做。

6
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:41,970
The following day, the patient asked for a bedside telephone.
第二天，这位病人要了一部床头电话。

7
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:50,650
When he was alone, he telephoned the hospital exchange and asked for Doctor Millington.
当病房里没人的时候，他给医院的总机打电话，要米灵顿医生接电话。

8
00:00:52,490 --> 00:00:55,020
When the doctor answered the phone,
医生接电话时，

9
00:00:55,690 --> 00:00:59,920
Mr. Gilbert said he was inquiring about a certain patient,
吉尔伯特先生说他想打听一个病人的情况，

10
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,570
a Mr. John Gilbert.
一位叫约翰·吉尔伯特的先生。

11
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:07,910
He asked if Mr. Gilbert's operation had been successful
他问吉尔伯特先生的手术是否成功，

12
00:01:07,930 --> 00:01:10,770
and the doctor told him that it had been.
医生告诉他手术很成功。

13
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:16,330
He then asked when Mr. Gilbert would be allowed to go home
接着他又问吉尔伯特先生什么时候可以回家，

14
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:22,350
and the doctor told him that he would have to stay in hosptial for another two weeks.
医生说他还得再住两个星期。

15
00:01:24,170 --> 00:01:29,280
Then Dr. Millington asked the caller if he was a relative of the patient.
后来米灵顿医生问打电话的人是不是病人的亲属。

16
00:01:31,750 --> 00:01:33,100
'No,' the patient answered,
“不是，”病人回答说，

17
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:35,740
'I am Mr. John Gilbert.  '
“我就是约翰·吉尔伯特先生。”
